  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每场回合制遭遇都要求同时利用角色能力、地形、占领目标和早先拾取的道具来破局",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Battle through difficult encounters where you must use everything at your disposal to prevail against the enemy, be it unique abilities, using the environment to your advantage, capturing objectives or finding the perfect use for the item you picked up earlier.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2269540/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "Void Day后Dark Matter驱动器爆炸并撕裂大陆，三大阵营在废墟中形成",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "It all started after Void Day, a cataclysmic event where all of Vertex’s Dark Matter drives around the globe imploded creating Void Zones which swallowed cities and ripped apart continents. From the chaos three factions emerged: the Military, PUNKZ and Vertex. Each faction has its own style in both design and gameplay.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2269540/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "Commander既是可操作角色也是Boss，每人拥有专属能力与对话",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Commanders function both as playable characters and bosses! Each Commander has their own set of abilities and unique dialogue.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2269540/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
